XLSP5 p5 vdd vdda vss bp5 bbp5 r1_safe_ls
XLSN5 n5 vdd vdda vss bn5 bbn5 r1_safe_ls
XLSP6 p6 vdd vdda vss bp6 bbp6 r1_safe_ls
XLSN6 n6 vdd vdda vss bn6 bbn6 r1_safe_ls
XLSP7 p7 vdd vdda vss bp7 bbp7 r1_safe_ls
